{
  "declaredLength": 9376,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Quel Pokémon au corps fait de plasma est capable\nd’entrer dans les appareils électriques ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est Motisma bien sûr !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004320190065007300740020004D006F007400690073006D00610020006200690065006E0020007300FB00720020002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous possédez un Motismart, n’est-ce pas ?\nC’est un appareil très précieux.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En effet, nous n’aurions pas de Motismart\nsi Motisma n’existait pas !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000650066006600650074002C0020006E006F007500730020006E20190061007500720069006F006E007300200070006100730020006400650020004D006F007400690073006D006100720074000A007300690020004D006F007400690073006D00610020006E20190065007800690073007400610069007400200070006100730020002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais son talent ne s’arrête pas là, Motisma peut\ns’infiltrer dans des tas d’appareils électriques !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et si nous faisions une démonstration\ndes prouesses de Motisma en combat ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si ça vous intéresse d’affronter les différentes\nformes de Motisma, revenez me voir !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai hâte de voir dans quels appareils Motisma\nva s’introduire !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019006100690020006800E20074006500200064006500200076006F00690072002000640061006E00730020007100750065006C007300200061007000700061007200650069006C00730020004D006F007400690073006D0061000A007600610020007320190069006E00740072006F006400750069007200650020002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous êtes sur le point de vous battre contre\ndifférentes formes de Motisma. Êtes-vous prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui, c’est bon !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750069002C00200063201900650073007400200062006F006E002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah non, pas encore...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100680020006E006F006E002C002000700061007300200065006E0063006F00720065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, jetez-vous à l’eau !\nMotisma a envie de se battre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C0020006A006500740065007A002D0076006F00750073002000E00020006C201900650061007500200021000A004D006F007400690073006D00610020006100200065006E00760069006500200064006500200073006500200062006100740074007200650020002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mesdames et Messieurs ! Préparez-vous à être\nébahis par l’incroyable collaboration entre<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMotisma et des machines ! Commençons par...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh là là, quel appareil va-t-il choisir ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020006C00E00020006C00E0002C0020007100750065006C00200061007000700061007200650069006C002000760061002D0074002D0069006C002000630068006F00690073006900720020003F00100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Motisma Chaleur ! C’est ainsi qu’on appelle\nun Motisma dans un four à micro-ondes !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il est de types Électrik et Feu.\nMais alors, ça signifie qu’il perd le type Spectre ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et ce n’est pas tout, car il peut aussi apprendre\nla capacité Surchauffe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si Motisma est bien luné, votre dîner sera parfait !\nSinon... il sera tout carbonisé !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce combat Pokémon va mettre en valeur\ntoutes les qualités de Motisma !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors ? Motisma Chaleur vous a-t-il donné\ndes sueurs froides ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F007200730020003F0020004D006F007400690073006D00610020004300680061006C00650075007200200076006F0075007300200061002D0074002D0069006C00200064006F006E006E00E9000A0064006500730020007300750065007500720073002000660072006F00690064006500730020003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, on enchaîne !\nMotisma va entrer dans une machine à laver !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C0065007A002C0020006F006E00200065006E00630068006100EE006E006500200021000A004D006F007400690073006D006100200076006100200065006E0074007200650072002000640061006E007300200075006E00650020006D0061006300680069006E0065002000E00020006C00610076006500720020002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! Un Motisma Lavage ? Je dis OUI !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020002100200055006E0020004D006F007400690073006D00610020004C006100760061006700650020003F0020004A006500200064006900730020004F005500490020002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Motisma Lavage est de types Électrik et Eau !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F007400690073006D00610020004C006100760061006700650020006500730074002000640065002000740079007000650073002000C9006C00650063007400720069006B00200065007400200045006100750020002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il peut apprendre la capacité Hydrocanon !\nC’est trop canon, non ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C00200070006500750074002000610070007000720065006E0064007200650020006C00610020006300610070006100630069007400E900200048007900640072006F00630061006E006F006E00200021000A00432019006500730074002000740072006F0070002000630061006E006F006E002C0020006E006F006E0020003F002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et il est sympa, il ne lance pas le programme\nde lavage si on a oublié de mettre la lessive !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais attention ! Le risque d’inondation subsiste !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610069007300200061007400740065006E00740069006F006E002000210020004C006500200072006900730071007500650020006420190069006E006F006E0064006100740069006F006E0020007300750062007300690073007400650020002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous voyez bien que Motisma Lavage mérite\nun torrent d’éloges !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0075007300200076006F00790065007A0020006200690065006E00200071007500650020004D006F007400690073006D00610020004C006100760061006700650020006D00E90072006900740065000A0075006E00200074006F007200720065006E007400200064201900E9006C006F0067006500730020002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’attire maintenant votre attention sur cette\ntondeuse... ou plutôt, sur ce Motisma Tonte !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Incroyable !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E00630072006F007900610062006C00650020002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\"",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Motisma Tonte possède les types Électrik et\nPlante !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F007400690073006D006100200054006F006E0074006500200070006F0073007300E8006400650020006C00650073002000740079007000650073002000C9006C00650063007400720069006B002000650074000A0050006C0061006E007400650020002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et il peut apprendre la capacité Tempête Verte !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200069006C00200070006500750074002000610070007000720065006E0064007200650020006C00610020006300610070006100630069007400E9002000540065006D007000EA007400650020005600650072007400650020002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il faut toutefois s’assurer d’avoir un jardin assez\ngrand pour satisfaire son envie de tondre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et accepter qu’il éparpille de l’herbe partout !\nMais, quel petit coquin !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿'",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00270000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce Motisma Tonte s’avère pratique pour couper\nl’herbe sous le pied de vos adversaires, pas vrai ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Au suivant ! Un Motisma dans un ventilateur !\nOn l’appelle Motisma Hélice !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il est à couper le souffle !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C0020006500730074002000E000200063006F00750070006500720020006C006500200073006F007500660066006C00650020002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿+",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les types de Motisma Hélice sont Électrik et Vol !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500730020007400790070006500730020006400650020004D006F007400690073006D00610020004800E9006C00690063006500200073006F006E0074002000C9006C00650063007400720069006B00200065007400200056006F006C0020002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et il peut apprendre la capacité Lame d’Air !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200069006C00200070006500750074002000610070007000720065006E0064007200650020006C00610020006300610070006100630069007400E90020004C0061006D00650020006420190041006900720020002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le ventilateur étant équipé de reconnaissance\nvocale, ce Motisma répondra à tous vos ordres !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais ce petit farceur aime souffler sur vos papiers\nimportants pour les regarder s’envoler !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, ce Motisma Hélice ?\nIl décoiffe, pas vrai ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F00720073002C0020006300650020004D006F007400690073006D00610020004800E9006C0069006300650020003F000A0049006C0020006400E90063006F0069006600660065002C0020007000610073002000760072006100690020003F00100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et pour finir, un Motisma dans un réfrigérateur !\nLe bien nommé Motisma Froid !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Comment rester de glace devant un tel Pokémon ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D006D0065006E0074002000720065007300740065007200200064006500200067006C00610063006500200064006500760061006E007400200075006E002000740065006C00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020003F002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿4",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00340000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Motisma Froid est de types Électrik et Glace !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F007400690073006D0061002000460072006F006900640020006500730074002000640065002000740079007000650073002000C9006C00650063007400720069006B00200065007400200047006C0061006300650020002100100002011401A80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il peut apprendre Blizzard, en plus !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 6972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C00200070006500750074002000610070007000720065006E00640072006500200042006C0069007A007A006100720064002C00200065006E00200070006C007500730020002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il aime tout geler autour de lui !\nCe n’est pas très vendeur, je sais...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 7056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À propos, j’ai entendu dire que Motisma change\nde forme grâce à un moteur spécial...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 7212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿9",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 7392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le charme de Motisma m’a tant hypnotisé que je\nn’ai pas remarqué que les combats étaient finis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 7404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et encore, nous n’avons pas parlé du Motisma\nDrone et de la Moticyclette de Galar...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 7608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Où qu’il se trouve, Motisma est un petit\nchenapan !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 7788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00F900200071007520190069006C002000730065002000740072006F007500760065002C0020004D006F007400690073006D0061002000650073007400200075006E002000700065007400690074000A006300680065006E006100700061006E0020002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La présence de Motisma rend les appareils\nélectriques moins... dociles, je l’avoue.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 7900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais je suis sûre que quelqu’un comme vous\nsaura tirer parti de ses formes en combat !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 8076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour conclure, j’ai l’honneur de vous présenter\nun catalogue pour changer Motisma de forme !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 8260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si vous en capturez un dans la nature,\nce catalogue vous sera très utile.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 8456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peut-être que si nous continuons à inventer des\nappareils, Motisma prendra de nouvelles formes ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 8612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Motisma n’a aucune limite !\nOn devrait le renommer « Infinitisma » !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 8816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F007400690073006D00610020006E2019006100200061007500630075006E00650020006C0069006D00690074006500200021000A004F006E002000640065007600720061006900740020006C0065002000720065006E006F006D006D00650072002000AB00200049006E00660069006E0069007400690073006D0061002000BB0020002100100002011401A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿C",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 8964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous servez-vous du catalogue que je vous ai\ndonné pour changer Motisma de forme ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 8976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Peut-être qu’un jour, un Motisma entrera dans\nun de vos appareils pour vous faire une blague !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƩ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 9152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mohohoho...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 9352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F0068006F0068006F0068006F002E002E002E0000",
